nd no finding either way. POL-NS-04 was correctly not reached — the chat log holds 0 messages and in_app_calls is empty — but that does not matter, because the refund comes from the grace clock, not from any failure of contact.\n\nNothing the ruling rests on is impaired under POL-NS-08 limbs (a)–(d): the trace is COMPLETE at 1.0 with 100% coverage and no gap, the fare ledger reconciles to 4.50, and the chat log's 0 messages match the trip record's count. The deciding fact — the grace clock — is carried by EV-TRIP-02737 at weight 1.0 and the amount by EV-FARE-02737 at weight 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0 and my confidence is 0.95. No POL-NS-09 trigger fires and the case does not escalate. The monetary effect, SGD 4.50, is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of SGD 8.00 and executes automatically."
